OL,3,GNEWSAContentious Orange Order parade
OL,4,Acan go ahead, commission says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Parades Commission has announced
OL,7,Fthat a planned Orange Order parade is
OL,8,Fto be allowed on the mainly-nationalist
OL,9,FGarvaghy Road in Portadown.
OL,11,FThe commission said the parade on
OL,12,FSunday should start earlier than the
OL,13,FOrange Order wanted and with fewer
OL,14,Fpeople - but can go ahead.
OL,16,FThe decision is facing a legal
OL,17,Fchallenge from the Garvaghy Road
OL,18,FResidents' Coalition which opposes the
OL,19,Fmarch and has said the challenge will
OL,20,Fbe heard on Saturday morning.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
