OL,3,GNEWSAContentious Orange Order parade
OL,4,Acan go ahead, commission says
OL,5,
OL,6,FRather than start at 13:00 BST on
OL,7,FSunday as intended, the commission has
OL,8,Fsaid the march can begin at 08:00 and
OL,9,Fwith 35 participants rather than the 60
OL,10,Fthe Orange Order requested.
